    {
      "id": "claim_0c5d862f533545f9aadcc99ac6555b7d",
      "statement": "Talon defines a common ChannelAdapter protocol for lifecycle, host message-handler registration, text/media send and edit, typing, and status; ChannelMessage and ChannelReaction carry channel-specific conversation and sender identity plus metadata, while reactions are an optional adapter capability.",
