      "statement": "Pairing grants normal sender invocation but never operator authority: environment-configured operator and allowlisted IDs remain authoritative DM senders, while /pair is handled outside the model and requires an explicitly configured operator; pairing administration is DM-only except that an operator may approve a code outside a DM.",
