      "id": "claim_be6fcebc13c54d09a59af2f1157265bf",
      "statement": "When replacing or stopping an active channel turn, the host increments its generation, cancels it, and attempts runtime recovery within 30 seconds. A timeout blocks further work for that agent conversation, while stale or cancelled undelivered turns requeue consumed background-subagent results.",
